Subject: [PATCH v2 1/6] Bluetooth: hci_qca: don't call kfree_skb() under spin_lock_irqsave()
Date:   Wed, 7 Dec 2022 10:18:30 +0800
Message-ID: <20221207021835.3012559-2-yangyingliang@huawei.com>
